# This repository is Markdown — the method is the deliverable, not code.
#
# Linguist classifies Markdown as prose and leaves prose out of the language
# statistics, so without this the repo reports no language at all and its card
# shows a blank where every other repo shows a dot. These two overrides say
# "count it": the claim is accurate, which is the only reason to make it.
*.md linguist-detectable=true linguist-documentation=false
